It's missing the `discriminator` field!
A tagged union with discriminator should have a `discriminator` object in the OpenAPI schema.

For example:
```json
"schema": {
  "anyOf": [
    { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Cat" },
    { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Dog" }
  ],
  "discriminator": {
    "propertyName": "type"
  },
  "title": "Data"
}
```

